<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia meat exports mixed in Sept 96 - ABS.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia meat exports mixed in Sept 96 - ABS.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian exports of fresh meat (tonnes) for September 1996 from the Australian Bureau of Statistics (ABS)-</p>
<p>		   Beef	Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		   Bone-in  Bone-in	 Bone-in     Bone-in</p>
<p> September 96  5,047     148	     6,051	4,198</p>
<p> August 96     3,740     122	     5,135	2,996</p>
<p> September 95  4,905     209	     5,552	3,687</p>
<p>		  Beef	 Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		  Bone-out   Bone-out     Bone-out    Bone-out</p>
<p> September 96 43,951	422	   3,361	 553</p>
<p> August 96    51,630	374	   3,442	 585</p>
<p> September 96 61,517	735	   4,575	 631</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-3-373-1800</p>
</text>
